<title>USA: Sheffield Medical hires financial advisor.</title>
<headline>Sheffield Medical hires financial advisor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Medical Technologies Inc said Monday it has hired the Stone Pine Cos to provide financial adivsory services.</p>
<p>Stone Pine will advise Sheffield on strategies for financing acquisitions and development of later stage pharmaceutical opportunities, Sheffield said.</p>
